### Demo 2: read a dispute email (structured output)
@host = http://localhost:8099

### 2a. A complete email: Acme Coffee double charge
POST {{host}}/api/disputes/emails
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../src/main/resources/emails/double-charge.txt

### 2b. An email with no card number: missingFields lists it
POST {{host}}/api/disputes/emails
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../src/main/resources/emails/package-never-arrived.txt

### 2c. A fraud email
POST {{host}}/api/disputes/emails
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../src/main/resources/emails/unknown-charge.txt

### 2d. Stretch: a short email plus a photo of the receipt
POST {{host}}/api/disputes/emails
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=receipt

--receipt
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../src/main/resources/emails/see-receipt.txt
--receipt
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="receipt"; filename="acme-coffee-receipt.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../src/main/resources/receipts/acme-coffee-receipt.png
--receipt--
